# Testing Rules
- Use Vitest. Import from 'vitest'.
- Test only src/lib/ functions. No component tests for MVP.
- Describe blocks mirror function names.
- Test edge cases: empty strings, zero, null, boundary values.
- Mock external services (KV, OpenAI, Claude) with vi.mock().
- Assertions: use explicit expect().toBe/toEqual/toThrow, not truthy/falsy.
